WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.138
Good morning! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.139 --> 00:00:24.193
I'm an emperor penguin.

3
00:00:24.194 --> 00:00:29.402
We're the biggest penguins in the world.

4
00:00:29.403 --> 00:00:32.257
Where do you live?

5
00:00:32.258 --> 00:00:37.760
Emperor penguins live in Antarctica.

6
00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:42.286
We live on the cold ice.

7
00:00:42.287 --> 00:00:45.828
We stay near water.

8
00:00:45.829 --> 00:00:48.818
Do you fly?

9
00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:53.977
Penguins have feathers.

10
00:00:53.978 --> 00:00:58.278
But we don't fly.

11
00:00:58.279 --> 00:01:12.155
We just swim.

12
00:01:12.156 --> 00:01:15.926
You can dive too!

13
00:01:15.927 --> 00:01:21.114
Emperor penguins can dive very deep.

14
00:01:21.115 --> 00:01:24.583
We dive to find food.

15
00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:29.496
We eat fish and squid.

16
00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:33.319
Do you lay eggs?

17
00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.596
The mother penguin lays one egg.

18
00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:42.572
Then the father takes care of the egg.

19
00:01:42.573 --> 00:01:46.213
How does the father do that?

20
00:01:46.214 --> 00:01:50.759
He holds the egg on his feet.

21
00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:56.890
Then he doesn't eat or go anywhere.

22
00:01:56.891 --> 00:02:02.441
After two months the egg finally hatches.

23
00:02:02.442 --> 00:02:05.954
How do you stay warm?

24
00:02:05.955 --> 00:02:09.942
We live in big groups.

25
00:02:09.943 --> 00:02:17.072
We huddle together in the cold.

26
00:02:17.073 --> 00:02:22.939
We take turns standing in the warmest spots.

27
00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:33.269
I'm ready to dive again. Good-bye!

28
00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:40.404
See you later, Emperor Penguin!
